      <message name="IDS_CRFILES_NEARBY_MAC_NETWORK_UNAVAILABLE" desc="macOS Nearby Sharing discovery repeatedly failed; network and Local Network permission troubleshooting, without asserting permission denial.">Nearby device discovery is unavailable. Check your network and allow crFiles in System Settings &gt; Privacy &amp; Security &gt; Local Network. If already allowed, turn access off and on. Retrying automatically.</message>
