      <message name="IDS_CRFILES_PHONE_SEND_ERROR" desc="crFiles file manager interface.">Could not finish sending. Check the connection, available phone storage and selected media (1–128 files, up to 16 GB each and 64 GB total). Completed files are kept.</message>
